idth=\"792\" style=\"width: 792px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏适龄，填写如下选项中一项</p><p>8</p><p>12</p><p>16</p><p>18</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"199\" style=\"width: 199px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>videoCover</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"109\" style=\"width: 109px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"118\" style=\"width: 118px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传视频之后，为必填，否则不需上传</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"792\" style=\"width: 792px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传视频封面的流水号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"199\" style=\"width: 199px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>simpleDesc</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"109\" style=\"width: 109px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"118\" style=\"width: 118px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"792\" style=\"width: 792px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>一句话简介</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"199\" style=\"width: 199px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>gamePrivileges</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"109\" style=\"width: 109px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Integer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"118\" style=\"width: 118px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"792\" style=\"width: 792px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏特权</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"199\" style=\"width: 199px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>icpRecordType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"109\" style=\"width: 109px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Integer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"118\" style=\"width: 118px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"792\" style=\"width: 792px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>核准（备案）类型, 0:需要核准（备案）, 1:不联网</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"199\" style=\"width: 199px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>icpLicenseType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"109\" style=\"width: 109px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Integer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"118\" style=\"width: 118px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"792\" style=\"width: 792px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>APP核准（备案）证件类型, 0:统一社会信用代码, 1:组织机构代码,2:其他</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"199\" style=\"width: 199px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>icpLicenseNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"109\" style=\"width: 109px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"118\" style=\"width: 118px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"792\" style=\"width: 792px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>APP核准（备案）证件号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"199\" style=\"width: 199px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>icpAuthLetter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"109\" style=\"width: 109px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"118\" style=\"width: 118px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"792\" style=\"width: 792px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>APP核准（备案）授权函, 上传接口返回的流水号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"199\" style=\"width: 199px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>offInternetLetter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"109\" style=\"width: 109px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"118\" style=\"width: 118px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"792\" style=\"width: 792px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>单机承诺函，上传接口返回的流水号，核准（备案）类型为不联网时填写</p></td></tr><tr><td colspa